<title>SRI LANKA: Lanka Lubricants '96 net falls 8.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Lanka Lubricants '96 net falls 8.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Lanka Lubricants Ltd for the 12 months ending 31 December, 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>			    1996		    1995</p>
<p>     Turnover	 2,119.97   vs	 1,778.03</p>
<p>     Net profit	 130.96   vs	   142.51</p>
<p>     Tax		   68.46   vs	   111.58</p>
<p>NOTE - Lanka Lubricants is a subsidiary of U.S. oil giant Caltex, owned jointly by Texaco Inc and Chevron Corp.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
